WEBVTT

00:00:05.353 --> 00:00:11.148
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:11.398 --> 00:00:16.930
Select Published from the Status list.

00:00:17.181 --> 00:00:21.844
Tick Select all on this page.

00:00:22.094 --> 00:00:26.089
Click Add to category.

00:00:26.339 --> 00:00:31.671
Select Science from the Category list.

00:00:31.921 --> 00:00:35.772
Click Apply.

00:00:36.022 --> 00:00:42.022
Check that Select all on this page
is there if you want to start again.
